OL,3,GNEWSARNLI volunteers facing
OL,4,A'unacceptable' abuse, chief says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRNLI staff have faced "unacceptable"
OL,7,Fonline and physical abuse since
OL,8,Fanti-migrant protests at the weekend,
OL,9,Fthe charity's chief executive has said.
OL,11,FOn Sunday, police faced off with
OL,12,Fdemonstrators who blocked roads in
OL,13,FPortsmouth in an effort to stop 140
OL,14,Fpeople who arrived at the Eastney
OL,15,FLanding ferry port area with the RNLI's
OL,16,Fassistance.
OL,18,FChief executive Peter Sparkes said the
OL,19,Fabuse of volunteers was "wholly
OL,20,Funacceptable in a civilised society".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
