OL,3,GNEWSARNLI volunteers facing
OL,4,A'unacceptable' abuse, chief says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said there had been "deliberate
OL,7,Fmisinformation and a misunderstanding"
OL,8,Fabout the charity, and condemned
OL,9,Fthreats by "those who would hide behind
OL,10,Fa balaclava or a keyboard".
